              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-3">
              <num>6</num>
              <heading>Subsection 73A(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “the <i>Asbestos</i><i>-</i><i>related Claims (Management of Commonwealth Liabilities) Act 2005</i>”, insert “or the <i>Parliamentary Entitlements Act 1990</i>”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-4">
              <num>7</num>
              <heading>At the end of paragraph 91(3)(a)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-4__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-4__qstr-1__para-vi">
                  <num>vi</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>	(vi)	the <i>Parliamentary Entitlements Act 1990</i>; and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
